#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Thesaurus Tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Thesaurus</guilabel> tab offers a small thesaurus, built from "
"a subset of <link linkend=\"frontend\">&wordnet;</link>. The results are "
"listed in three categories: <guilabel>Synonyms</guilabel>, <guilabel>More "
"General Words</guilabel> (hypernyms), <guilabel>More Specific Words</"
"guilabel> (hyponyms). Synonyms are words with a very similar meaning. They "
"do not necessarily apply to all senses of each word, so you cannot always "
"replace a word with any synonym."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can double click on a word to search for its synonyms &etc;. You can "
"also type a word directly into the search box at the top and press "
"<keycap>Return</keycap>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We have to keep the data file small so that it can be included in &calligra; "
"&mdash; this introduces several limitations (compared to &wordnet;):"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only exact matches are found, &eg; if you search for a plural form nothing "
"will be found."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Many not so common words have been removed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It doesn't distinguish between parts of speech, &eg; verbs and nouns are "
"mixed up in the lists of words."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "It won't separate the different meanings words can have."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adjectives don't really have a <quote>more general</quote> / <quote>more "
"specific</quote> meaning, so one word may appear in more than one list at "
"the same time."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the other hand, a few words have been added (function words like "
"<quote>if</quote> and very few words specific to &kde;)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please do <emphasis>not</emphasis> report bugs in the thesaurus to the "
"&wordnet; project, but to <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org\">&kde;</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &wordnet; tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>&wordnet;</guilabel> tab provides a user interface to a local "
"installation of <ulink url=\"http://wordnet.princeton.edu/\">&wordnet;</"
"ulink>. &wordnet; is <quote>an online lexical reference system whose design "
"is inspired by current psycholinguistic theories of human lexical memory.</"
"quote> The &kthesaurus; user interface offers nearly all options which are "
"available on the command line. It calls the <command>wn</command>, which has "
"to be in your <envar>PATH</envar>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To learn more about &wordnet;, please see the &wordnet; <command>man</"
"command> pages or have a look at the <ulink url=\"http://wordnet.princeton."
"edu/\">&wordnet; homepage</ulink>."
msgstr ""

